### Full-win record card (step 10)

**Full run complete:** last stage of **level 5** cleared → `triggerFullWin()` sets `won` + `gameOver` (`advanceAfterStars` or bomb path). Gated by `isFullRunComplete(level, stageSlot, stageOrder.length)` in `game.ts`. **Not** on levels 1–4 stage clears or on lose.

**New-record gate (`isNewRunRecord`):**
- At run start (`New Game` / `Continue`), snapshot `runStartBestScoreRef` = current HUD `bestScore`
- On full win: `isNewRunRecord = finalScore > runStartBestScoreRef` (compare to **run-start** best, not live HUD — mid-run `bestScore` bumps would otherwise make `score === bestScore` at the end)

| Full win | `isNewRunRecord` | UI |
|----------|------------------|-----|
| Yes | `true` (beat run-start best) | `RecordCardOverlay` at `SafeAreaView` root (`zIndex` 1000) |
| Yes | `false` (did not beat run-start best) | Full-screen tap overlay: `gameOver.titleWin` + `gameOver.win` → `restartFromLevelOne()` |
| Lose | — | `gameOver.titleLose` + mode-specific body; tap → `restart()` (retry stage) |

**`RecordCardOverlay.tsx`:** `recordCard.title` (not `titleWin`), final score, 3-letter initials, **Save** → `saveLeaderboardEntry` + rank, **Play Again** → `restartFromLevelOne()` (save optional).

**`restartFromLevelOne()`:** clear `savedGame`, reset score to 0, fresh run from level 1 stage 0 (`createFreshRunState`), re-snapshot `runStartBestScore`, clear `won` / `gameOver` / `isNewRunRecord`. Does **not** return to intro.

**Sequence:** stage goal met → stars (~1.5s) → record card **or** completion overlay; fireworks on any full win (`won && gameOver`).

**i18n:** `recordCard.*` (card UI); `gameOver.titleWin` + `gameOver.win` (non-record full win only)

**Deferred:** “View board” from record card → `LeaderboardView` with `highlightRank`; HUD `bestScore` vs `leaderboard[0]` unification.

**Files:** `RecordCardOverlay.tsx`, `App.tsx`, `useCandyBreak.ts`, `game.ts` (`isFullRunComplete`, `MAX_LEVEL`), `utils/leaderboard.ts`, `i18n/*`

### Dev full-win flags (testing aids)

Both `__DEV__ && false` by default; never active in production. Wired via `isDevForceFullWin()` → `triggerFullWin()` (bomb + `advanceAfterStars`).

| Flag | Starts at | One clear → full win |
|------|-----------|------------------------|
| `DEV_QUICK_FULL_WIN` | Level 1, stage 0 | Yes (skips levels 2–5) |
| `DEV_SIMULATE_LEVEL5_WIN` | Level 5, **last** stage (`createLevel5LastStageRun` on New Game) | Yes (production path position) |

**Helpers:** `isDevQuickFullWin`, `isDevSimulateLevel5Win`, `isDevForceFullWin`, `isFullRunComplete` in `game.ts`; `createFreshRunState` / `createLevel5LastStageRun` in `useCandyBreak.ts`.

